  "bio": "BB June is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Asheville, United States, known for their proficiency in the illustrative tattoo style. Operating out of Thistle and Pearl Tattoo, BB's work showcases a remarkable level of detail and creativity, making them a sought-after artist in the area. In addition to their tattooing talent, BB is also dedicated to being a loving parent to E+E, balancing their professional passion with family life.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Asheville, North Carolina, United States"
